+4.  **Error Aggregation and Subdivision:**
+    For each leaf node $F$:
+    *   Calculate the average rendering error $e_F$ over all rays $r_i$ emitted from $F$:
+        $$ e_F = \text{mean}_{r_i \in F} (V_\Theta(r_i) - c_i) $$
